The close-region and far-region two particle correlations function would have contributions of

* close-region 2p corr. = flow + near-side jet + away-side jet \(fraction_{close}\)
* far-region 2p corr. = flow + near-side jet + away-side jet \(fraction_{far}\)

The correlation difference measures the away-side jet shape where the anisotropic flow background is cleanly subtracted.

