### 3.5 Single particle efficiency correction

The single-particle acceptance and detection efficiency \(\epsilon\) (Eq. 3.2) is given by

\[\epsilon=\epsilon_{\phi}\cdot\epsilon_{\eta}\, \tag{3.2}\]

\(\epsilon_{\phi}\) (Eq. 3.3) and \(\epsilon_{\eta}\) (Eq. 3.4) are \(\phi\)- and \(\eta\)-dependent efficiency correction respectively.

