After runs with similar efficiency are grouped together, the \(\phi\)-dependent correction \(\epsilon_{\phi}\) (Eq. 3.3) is given by

\[\epsilon_{\phi}|_{group,centrality,p_{T}}=\frac{dN}{d\phi}|_{run,centrality,p_{ T}}/A_{0}\, \tag{3.3}\]

